{"title":"AEA: Honoring Milton Friedman","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/939577229/0/marginalrevolution~AEA-Honoring-Milton-Friedman.html","date":1767356722000,"content":"<p>Looks like a good AEA session on Sunday in Philly:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>“<b>Honoring Milton Friedman on his 50th Anniversary of Winning the Nobel Prize” </b></p>\r\n<p>Mark Skousen: “My Friendly Fights with Milton Friedman”\r\n<br />\r\nJeremy Siegel: “Milton Friedman’s contributions to financial markets and the influence of money on the business cycle.”\r\n<br />\r\nJames K. Galbraith: “Milton Friedman’s Critique of Keynesian Economics and Fiscal Policy: A Response”\r\n<br />\r\nMichael Bordo: “The Future of Monetarism After Friedman: What Works, What Doesn’t.”\r\n<br />\r\nJudy Shelton: “Milton Friedman and Robert Mundell: Who Won the Nobel Money Duel?”</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>To be held Sunday Jan. 4, 8-10 am ET at the Philadelphia Marriott Hotel, Grand Ballroom Salon B.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/aea-honoring-milton-friedman.html\">AEA: Honoring Milton Friedman</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/939577229/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/939577229/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/939577229/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/939577229/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/939577229/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://a